---
const {base}=Astro.props;
---
<section class="relationship-explorer" aria-labelledby="relationship-title">
 <h3 id="relationship-title">See what holds the deck together.</h3>
 <p>Choose a card, then look beside it. Your connections, symbol notes and saved visual choices offer different ways to consider the same collection. Nothing is interpreted, rearranged or scored for you.</p>
 <div data-relationship-cards class="relationship-strip" role="group" aria-label="Choose a card to explore"/>
 <label class="studio-field">Look through<select data-relationship-lens><option value="connections">My connections and journey</option><option value="colour">Color and treatment</option><option value="symbols">Symbol notes</option><option value="family">Families</option></select></label>
 <div data-relationship-focus class="relationship-focus"/>
 <div data-relationship-context aria-live="polite"/>
 <p class="relationship-destination">Connections belong to your Deck Blueprint. Changes use the existing private Architecture save; the confirmed save status appears below the chapter. Viewing cards does not change their order.</p>
 <button type="button" class="studio-button studio-button--secondary" data-document-moment="architecture" data-step="5">View my Deck Blueprint</button> <a href={`${base}/project-book/`}>My Project Book</a>
</section>
<style>
.relationship-explorer{padding:1.25rem;background:#f7f4ec;border:1px solid #d6d0c5;border-radius:5px;margin:1.5rem 0}.relationship-explorer h3{font:1.5rem/1.25 'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif}.relationship-strip{display:flex;gap:.65rem;overflow-x:auto;padding:.5rem .25rem 1rem;scroll-snap-type:x proximity}.relationship-strip :global(button){flex:0 0 7rem;min-width:0;padding:.4rem;border:1px solid #c5c2b8;background:#fffdf8;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;color:inherit;scroll-snap-align:start}.relationship-strip :global(button[aria-pressed=true]){outline:2px solid #536e78;outline-offset:1px}.relationship-strip :global(img),.relationship-strip :global(.relationship-empty){width:100%;height:7.5rem;object-fit:contain;display:block}.relationship-strip :global(strong){display:block;font:1rem/1.3 Georgia,serif;margin-top:.4rem}.relationship-strip :global(small){font-size:.75rem}.relationship-focus :global(article){display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(7rem,1fr) minmax(0,2fr);gap:1rem;align-items:start}.relationship-focus :global(img){display:block;width:100%;max-height:19rem;object-fit:contain}.relationship-focus :global(p){white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.relationship-focus :global(.relationship-empty){padding:3rem .5rem;text-align:center;border:1px solid #bbb7ad}.relationship-explorer :global(.relationship-neighbour){border-top:1px solid #d6d0c5;padding:1rem 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:5rem minmax(0,1fr);gap:.8rem}.relationship-explorer :global(.relationship-neighbour img){width:100%;height:7rem;object-fit:contain}.relationship-explorer :global(.relationship-neighbour p){white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.relationship-explorer :global(.relationship-swatch){display:inline-block;width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;border:1px solid #72776d;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:.4rem}.relationship-destination{font-size:.84rem}.relationship-explorer :global(button:focus-visible),.relationship-explorer select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #065e73;outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:520px){.relationship-explorer{padding:.8rem}.relationship-focus :global(article){grid-template-columns:6rem minmax(0,1fr)}.relationship-strip :global(button){flex-basis:6rem}}
.relationship-explorer :global(.relationship-prose){overflow-wrap:anywhere;overflow-x:auto;max-width:100%}
</style>
